WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.575
Now catch the mistakes.

2
00:00:01.575 --> 00:00:06.025
An administrator gave the verifier
the I T I L role as well.

3
00:00:06.025 --> 00:00:09.618
The comparison finds nothing
missing, one role extra,

4
00:00:09.618 --> 00:00:13.538
says least privilege doesn't
hold, and exits with a failure.

5
00:00:13.538 --> 00:00:17.374
Then try the evidence export
reusing the verifier's account.

6
00:00:17.374 --> 00:00:21.600
It would work, which is the trap: it
would also be able to close findings.

7
00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:26.275
The tool reports the evidence reader role
missing and the verifier role extra.

8
00:00:26.275 --> 00:00:30.580
Finally, the original ServiceNow
client tests: seven pass.
